# Cloudflare Pages serves index.html (200) for any unmatched route ONLY when
# there is no top-level 404.html — that automatic SPA fallback is what
# replaces Azure SWA's navigationFallback rewrite. The app renders its own
# in-app "not found" view for bad module paths.
404.html
